rast="none" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" class="TextRun SCXW141000561 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-ligatures: none !important; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 9pt; line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, Arial_EmbeddedFont, Arial_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW141000561 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;">^Sponsors who host a blood drive(s) during the promotional period (7/1/2024–08/31/2024) and meet their blood drive goal. This offer is non-transferable and not redeemable </span><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW141000561 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; background-position: 0px 100%; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-image: var(--urlContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2,url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI1IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjMiPjxnIGZpbGw9Im5vbmUiIGZpbGwtcnVsZT0iZXZlbm9kZCIgc3Ryb2tlPSIjMzVGIiBzdHJva2UtbGluZWNhcD0icm91bmQiPjxwYXRoIGQ9Ik0wIC41aDVNMCAyLjVoNSIvPjwvZz48L3N2Zz4=&quot;)); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;">for</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW141000561 BCX8" style="-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;"> cash. Limit one (1) $100 Amazon.com Holiday Leader Gift Card per Blood Drive Primary Contact email address during the promotional period. This offer is subject to change at any time in the promotional period. Blood Program Leader must have a valid email address on file. Instructions on how to claim the gift card will be sent via email to the primary contact Blood Program Leader of the blood drive. The online claim form must be completed within </span><